{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]O Zi[Eb7]on, [Ab]haste, [Eb7]thy [Ab]mission high [Eb7]fulfill[Fm]ing,
[Db]To tell to [Ab]all the [Eb7]world that God is [Ab]light,
[Ab]That [Bm7]He who [Ab]made all [C]na[Fm]tions [Fm7]is[C7]not wil[Fm]ling
[Bb]One [Eb]soul [Bb7]should [Eb]per[Cm]ish, [Fm]lost in [Bb7]shades of [Eb]night.
[Eb7]Publish glad [Ab]tidings, [Eb7]Tidings of [Ab]pea[Ab7]ce;
[F7]Tidings of [Bbm]Je[Db]sus, re[Ab]demption [Eb7]and [Ab]release.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Ab][Eb7]Publish [Ab]glad [Eb7]tidings, [Ab]tidings [Eb7]of [Fm]peace;
[Db]tidings [Ab]of Jesus, [Eb7]redemption [Ab]and release.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Proclaim [Eb7]to [Ab]every [Eb7]people, [Ab]tongue, [Eb7]and [Fm]nation
[Db]that God, [Ab]in whom they [Eb7]live and [Ab]move, is love;
[Ab]tell [Bm7]how [Ab]he [C]stooped [Fm]to [Fm7]save [C7]his [Fm]lost creation,
[Bb]and [Eb]died [Bb7]on [Eb]earth [Cm]that [Fm]we [Bb7]might [Eb]live above.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]Give [Eb7]of [Ab]thine [Eb7]own to [Ab]bear [Eb7]the [Fm]message glorious;
[Db]give of [Ab]thy wealth to [Eb7]speed them [Ab]on their way;
[Ab]pour [Bm7]out [Ab]thy [C]soul [Fm]for [Fm7]them [C7]in [Fm]prayer victorious;
[Bb]O [Eb]Zion, [Bb7]haste [Eb]to [Cm]bring [Fm]the [Bb7]brighter [Eb]day.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Ab]He [Eb7]comes [Ab]again; [Eb7]O Zion, [Ab]ere [Eb7]thou [Fm]meet Him,
[Db]Make known [Ab]to every [Eb7]heart His [Ab]saving grace;
[Ab]Let [Bm7]none [Ab]whom [C]He hath [Fm]ransomed [Fm7]fail [C7]to [Fm]greet Him,
[Bb]Through [Eb]thy [Bb7]neglect, [Eb]unfit [Cm]to [Fm]see [Bb7]His [Eb]face.
{end_of_verse}
